From: lichenggang <lichenggang@uniontech.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 19:10:00 +0800
Subject: quirks: match the ThinkBook G8+ pressure pads by family

The ThinkBook G8+ touchpads are Goodix GXTP5100 pressure pads that
report pressure as contact size. Without a pressure pad quirk libinput
treats every touch as a huge contact and discards it, so the touchpad
can click but not move the pointer.

The existing entries spell out the platform suffix
(pvrThinkBook14G8+IPH / pvrThinkBook16G8+IPH), which leaves the other
members of the family - e.g. the ThinkBook 16 G8+ AGP reported upstream
in issue 1323 - with a dead touchpad.

Match the whole G8+ family instead, still requiring the GXTP5100 device
name so that only the haptic pad is affected. The non-plus G8 models
(pvrThinkBook14G8IRL and friends), the G7+ series, the ThinkPad X9 and
other vendors do not match either the product glob or the device name.

Kept the two existing per-model entries: they are now redundant but
harmless, and removing them would make this patch conflict with the
already merged one for no benefit.

Ref: https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/libinput/libinput/-/issues/1323
Forwarded: not-needed (downstream quirk, upstream covers this by USB ID)
Signed-off-by: lichenggang <lichenggang@uniontech.com>
---
 quirks/50-system-lenovo.quirks | 15 +++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 15 insertions(+)

diff --git a/quirks/50-system-lenovo.quirks b/quirks/50-system-lenovo.quirks
@@ -437,3 +437,18 @@
 MatchDMIModalias=dmi:*svnLENOVO:*pvrThinkBook16G8+IPH*:*
 MatchUdevType=touchpad
 ModelPressurePad=1
+
+# The ThinkBook G8+ family ships the same Goodix GXTP5100 pressure pad
+# under several platform suffixes (IPH, AGP, ...). Matching the suffix
+# one by one leaves the other variants with a touchpad that can click
+# but not move, see
+# https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/libinput/libinput/-/issues/1323 for a
+# ThinkBook 16 G8+ AGP.
+#
+# Match the family instead, still requiring the GXTP5100 device name so
+# only the haptic pad is affected.
+[Lenovo ThinkBook G8+ touchpad]
+MatchName=*GXTP5100*
+MatchDMIModalias=dmi:*svnLENOVO:*pvrThinkBook*G8+*:*
+MatchUdevType=touchpad
+ModelPressurePad=1
